## Severity: Low Risk

## Context
MiniPoolPiReserveInterestRateStrategy.sol#L217

## Description
Aggregate (Cod3x and MinipoolOwner) reserveFactor can be 100%, and in that case a divide by zero could cause an interest rate update in `MiniPoolPiReserveInterestRateStrategy.calculateInterestRates`.

## Recommendation
Check that `PercentageMath.PERCENTAGE_FACTOR - reserveFactor` is not zero:

```solidity
if (currentLiquidityRate < minLiquidityRate && utilizationRate != 0) {
    // Original code
    // ...
}

+ if (currentLiquidityRate < minLiquidityRate &&
+     utilizationRate != 0 &&
+     (PercentageMath.PERCENTAGE_FACTOR - reserveFactor != 0)) {
    currentLiquidityRate = minLiquidityRate;
    currentVariableBorrowRate = currentLiquidityRate.rayDiv(
        utilizationRate.percentMul(PercentageMath.PERCENTAGE_FACTOR - reserveFactor)
    );
}
```

